      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't really get the comparison, i just need the technical specs for the audit. can you just clarify if there are any specific container types or methods you recommend to ensure we hit those cooling windows accurately? and what's the max temp we should be aiming for in the storage fridge after that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
